the .avp format is a simplifed version of the .xpm format (Version 3), while it shares a large amount of the synthax, it's a little more human readable and editable(when needed), it has the following synthax of:

"1"= True, foreground hue

"0"= False, background hue

" "= None, transparent pixel

Starview applications must be compiled with a .avp icon as part of the program headder.